- Schedule: epochs 1-50 = 100% GT f0, 50-150 = linear anneal, 150-300 = 100% generated f0
- Online DDIM: 20 steps, η=0.3 (faster than full 50 steps)
- Diffusion frozen from exp034, baseline from exp033
- 300 epochs total, amp_lr=5e-5, corr_weight=0.3, grad_weight=0.2

